WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.969
A spill needs immediate control.

2
00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.485
Warn others, isolate the area, and use the correct spill procedure.

3
00:00:06.485 --> 00:00:08.463
Do not walk through an unknown liquid.

4
00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:11.035
Check stacked goods before working nearby.

5
00:00:11.035 --> 00:00:15.042
Leaning, damaged, or overloaded stacks need trained help.

6
00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:17.740
Never pull one item from an unstable stack.

7
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.724
Stop, secure the area, and report it.
